---
import { SITE } from "@/utils/constants.js";
---

<section class="pt-20 pb-16 md:pt-28 md:pb-24 border-b border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800/80 transition-colors">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 text-center">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-200 text-xs text-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-400 mb-8">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
      <span>Windows 10 / 11 • Работает без интернета</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 leading-[1.1]">
      Печать накладных и чеков <span class="text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">за 30 секунд</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-6 text-lg sm:text-xl text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      Простая и надежная программа для розничных магазинов и ИП. Без подписок, облачных сбоев и обучения кассиров.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3">
      <a
        href={SITE.downloadUrl}
        class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white bg-zinc-900 hover:bg-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-950 dark:bg-zinc-100 dark:hover:bg-white rounded-md transition-all shadow-sm">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4"></path></svg>
        Скачать для Windows (.exe)
      </a>
      <a
        href="/pricing"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-700 bg-zinc-100 hover:bg-zinc-200 dark:text-zinc-300 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:hover:bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-300 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-md transition-all">
        Купить навсегда за {SITE.price}
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- App UI Preview Mockup -->
    <div class="mt-16 rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900/50 p-2 sm:p-4 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 mb-3 border-b border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 px-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-zinc-300 dark:bg-zinc-700"></div>
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-zinc-300 dark:bg-zinc-700"></div>
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-zinc-300 dark:bg-zinc-700"></div>
          <span class="text-xs text-zinc-500 font-mono ml-2">express-nakladnaya.exe — Режим продаж</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-mono">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
          База: Локальная (SQLite)
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-zinc-950 rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800/80 p-4 sm:p-6 text-left font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 space-y-4 shadow-inner">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 pb-3 border-b border-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-900">
          <div>
            <span class="text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500">Накладная №:</span> <span class="text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 font-bold">#142</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500">Дата:</span> <span class="text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">14.11.2026, 12:45</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500">Кассир:</span> <span class="text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">ИП Смирнов А.В.</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-2">
          <div class="text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Товары в чеке:</div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-2 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 pb-1 border-b border-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-900 text-xs">
            <div class="col-span-6">Наименование</div>
            <div class="col-span-2 text-right">Кол-во</div>
            <div class="col-span-2 text-right">Цена</div>
            <div class="col-span-2 text-right">Сумма</div>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-2 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200 py-1 text-xs">
            <div class="col-span-6 truncate">1. Краска интерьерная белая 9л</div>
            <div class="col-span-2 text-right">2 шт</div>
            <div class="col-span-2 text-right">1 450 ₽</div>
            <div class="col-span-2 text-right font-bold">2 900 ₽</div>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-2 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200 py-1 text-xs">
            <div class="col-span-6 truncate">2. Валик малярный профи 250мм</div>
            <div class="col-span-2 text-right">1 шт</div>
            <div class="col-span-2 text-right">350 ₽</div>
            <div class="col-span-2 text-right font-bold">350 ₽</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-3 border-t border-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-900 flex justify-between items-center text-sm">
          <span class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 font-sans">Итого к оплате:</span>
          <span class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-mono">3 250 ₽</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
